**In your page file:**
```python
def __init__(self, driver, actions):
    self.driver = driver
    self.actions = actions
    self.P_SELECT_SPAN_XPATH = ("xpath", "//form//div//div//p-select//span[@class='span_class_name']")

def select_dropdown_option_by_aria(self, aria_id):
    self.actions.click(self.P_SELECT_SPAN_XPATH)
    self.actions.wait_for_element_visible(("xpath", "//span[@aria-expanded='true']"))
    option_xpath = ("xpath", f"//*[@id='{aria_id}']")
    self.actions.click(option_xpath)
```

**In your test:**
```python
page.select_dropdown_option_by_aria("aria_id_value_here")
```

Replace `span_class_name` with the actual class and `aria_id_value_here` with the aria-activedescendant value you want to select.
